---
name: sim-render-split
description: FPS domain rules and engine physics have separate test contracts
---

domain/ is RefCounted-only, seeded, fixed-tick game rules. world/ owns Godot
physics/navigation and scene lifecycle. input/ gives human and bot the same
commands. render/ui observe state. Repeat exact hashes only for pure rules;
use scenario assertions with documented tolerances for physics. Never claim a
passing domain replay proves whole-game determinism. Read {{ROOT_DOC}} for paths.
